.TH "nvme_init_abort" 9 "nvme_init_abort" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_abort \- Initialize passthru command for Abort command
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_abort
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "__u16 sqid "  ","
.BI "__u16 cid "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sqid" 12
Submission Queue Identifier (SQID) of the command to abort
.IP "cid" 12
Command Identifier (CID) of the command to abort
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Abort command.
